      },
      "content": "TL;DR of today’s post:\n\n- Since 2015, NFL teams going for 2 down 8 are 4-41-0 (.089 pct).\n- Teams kicking an XP down 8 are 18-121-3 (.137 pct).\n\n- Since 2025, 2-pt attempters are 2-11-0 (.154 pct)\n- XP takers are 2-8-1 (.227 pct)\n\nShould sports analytics be judged by their track record?",
